From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 13:37:04 +0200
Subject: drm/sun4i: Share the DE33 DMA address space

All DE33 memory clients share one IOMMU master and must therefore allocate
and map buffers through the same device and domain.

Use the shared planes device as the DRM DMA device, allocate mixer RCQ
memory through it and defer writeback RCQ allocation until bind can
select that same DMA device.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Link: https://github.com/LibreELEC/LibreELEC.tv/blob/12207af344a0de3341243325bd8400df043fd81d/projects/Allwinner/patches/linux/0240-drm-sun4i-Share-the-DE33-DMA-address-space.patch
[aiyengar: sun50i_wb.c and sun8i_rdma_init() hunks dropped: this tree
 has neither the writeback driver nor DE33 RCQ; DMA mask 32 bits, as
 the layers write only the low address registers]
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_planes.c | 6 ++++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_mixer.c   | 7 +++++++
 2 files changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_planes.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_planes.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_planes.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_planes.c
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
 #include <drm/drm_device.h>
 
 #include <linux/device.h>
+#include <linux/dma-mapping.h>
 #include <linux/io.h>
 #include <linux/mfd/syscon.h>
 #include <linux/module.h>
@@ -157,6 +158,11 @@ static int sun50i_planes_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	struct device *dev = &pdev->dev;
 	struct sun50i_planes *planes;
 	void __iomem *regs;
+	int ret;
+
+	ret = dma_set_mask_and_coherent(dev, DMA_BIT_MASK(32));
+	if (ret)
+		return dev_err_probe(dev, ret, "Cannot set DMA mask\n");
 
 	planes = devm_kzalloc(dev, sizeof(*planes), GFP_KERNEL);
 	if (!planes)
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_mixer.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_mixer.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_mixer.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_mixer.c
@@ -689,6 +689,13 @@ static int sun8i_mixer_bind(struct device *dev, struct device *master,
 		}
 
 		mixer->planes_dev = &pdev->dev;
+
+		/*
+		 * All DE33 memory clients share one IOMMU master. Use the
+		 * planes device for framebuffer and RCQ allocations so they
+		 * are mapped in the same domain.
+		 */
+		drm_dev_set_dma_dev(drm, mixer->planes_dev);
 	}
 
 	list_add_tail(&mixer->engine.list, &drv->engine_list);
-- 
Armbian

